loma programs, and super-specialty training.\\n\\nSpread across an expansive 100-acre green campus, the institution integrates state-of-the-art laboratories, lecture halls, and a massive multi-specialty teaching hospital equipped with advanced diagnostic and therapeutic systems. The hospital serves a vast population across Kanniyakumari and neighboring districts, offering extensive hands-on clinical exposure to medical students.\\n\\nWith a strong focus on academic rigor, research innovation, and compassionate patient care, Govt. Kanniyakumari Medical College continues to produce exceptional medical professionals who serve across the globe. The campus environment nurtures overall personal and professional development through cultural events, sports meets, and community health services.","highlights":["Established in 2001 with approval from NMC","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Expansive 100-acre campus with modern academic and hospital blocks","High patient volume providing rich clinical exposure","Renowned faculty with extensive research background","Comprehensive central library housing thousands of medical volumes","Active student councils, cultural committees, and sports clubs","Separate hostel accommodation for men and women","Regular rural health camps and public awareness programs","Strong placement and higher education progression records"],"departments":[{"name":"General Medicine","level":"PG"},{"name":"General Surgery","level":"PG"},{"name":"Obstetrics & Gynaecology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Paediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Orthopaedics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Radiology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{