 exposure and hands-on training to its students. The curriculum is meticulously designed in affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, ensuring that students meet the highest national healthcare standards.\\n\\nThe institute boasts state-of-the-art laboratories, modern classrooms, and a comprehensive library. Students benefit from the direct attachment to a multi-specialty hospital, which allows them to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application. The faculty comprises experienced doctors and senior technicians who are committed to mentoring the next generation of healthcare providers.\\n\\nOver the years, PIHS has maintained an excellent placement record, with graduates being recruited by top hospitals and diagnostic centers across India. The institution is focused not only on academic excellence but also on the holistic development of its students, equipping them with the compassion and ethical foundation necessary for a successful career in the medical field.","highlights":["Direct attachment to Preethi Multi-Specialty Hospital","Hands-on clinical training from year one","Experienced medical faculty and practitioners","State-of-the-art simulation laboratories","Excellent placement record in top healthcare facilities","Regular medical camps and community health programs","Advanced library with digital medical resources","Affordable fee structure for quality education","Strong alumni network in the healthcare sector","Focus on ethical and compassionate patient care"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anesthesia Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physician Assistant","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Radiography & Imaging Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Medical Laboratory Technology","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"ic