d across a sprawling 60-acre green campus on the Chennai-Trichy Highway, the institution is dedicated to offering world-class medical education, cutting-edge research, and accessible healthcare services. Affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC), the college attracts top-tier talent from across the country.\\n\\nThe 1000-bed multi-specialty teaching hospital attached to the college provides students with an extensive array of clinical case studies and hands-on patient care experience. The campus features ultra-modern lecture theaters, high-tech simulation centers, comprehensively equipped research laboratories, and a central library housing an exhaustive collection of national and international medical literature. The faculty comprises highly distinguished doctors, researchers, and academicians dedicated to mentoring medical students.\\n\\nSRM Trichy Medical College strongly emphasizes research and evidence-based medicine, encouraging students to participate in national medical conferences and publish in indexed journals. Beyond academics, the campus offers a vibrant student life with massive sports arenas, comfortable hostel accommodations, and various student-run clubs. Graduates from Trichy SRM are recognized globally for their clinical competence, ethical practices, and leadership in the medical community.","highlights":["1000-bed multi-specialty teaching hospital","Approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC)","State-of-the-art Clinical Skill Simulation Center","Eminent faculty with extensive medical expertise","Comprehensive central library with digital subscriptions","Strong emphasis on undergraduate and postgraduate research","24/7 emergency and trauma care training","Excellent campus infrastructure with extensive sports facilities","Global alumni network in top medical institutions","Regular CMEs and international medical conferences"],"departments":[{"name":"MBBS","level":"UG"},{"name":"MD General Medicine","level":"PG"},{"name":"MS General Surgery","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD Pediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"MS Orthopedics","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD Radiodiagnosis","level":"PG"},{"name":"MD Anesthesiology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"1000-Bed Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Clinical Training Base"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Research Labs"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Simulation Center"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"9.0 LPA","highestPackage":"18.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"NEET Qualification","desc":"Candidates must qualify the National Eligibility cum Entrance Test (NEET-UG for MBBS, NEET-PG for MD/MS)."},{"title":"Centralized Counseling","desc":"Admissions are routed through the Tamil Nadu State Medical Counseling and All India Quota Counseling based on NEET ranks."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Candidates allotted a seat must report to the college for physical verification of original certificates."},{"title":"Medical Fitness Check","desc":"Students must undergo a comprehensive medical examination conducted by the institutional medical board."},{"title":"Fee Payment and Enrollment","desc":"Final admission is confirmed upon payment of the stipulated tuition and hostel fees."}],"scholarships":["SRM Founder''s Scholarship","Merit Scholarship for Top NEET Scorers","Tamil Nadu Government Medical Scholarship","SC/ST Scholarship Grants","First Graduate Concession (Govt Quota)","Defense Personnel Ward Scholarship","Endowment Scholarships for Academic Excellence","Financial Aid for Economically Weaker Sections"],"events":["Aura - National Level Medical Fest","MEDCON - Annual Medical Conference","World Health Day Mega Camp","Annual Sports Fest - Colosseum","CME on Advanced Therapeutics","Inter-college Cultural Carnival"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Tiruchirappalli International Airport (25 km)","railway":"Tiruchirappalli Junction (22 km)","bustand":"Chatram Bus Stand (18 km)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"SRM Hospital (On Campus)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate multi-story AC and Non-AC blocks","High-speed Wi-Fi internet access","Modern dining halls with diverse menu options","Attached bathrooms with geysers","In-house gym and indoor games facilities","24/7 security with biometric access","Laundry and ironing services","Reading rooms on every floor"],"technicalClubs":["Medical Research Society","Anatomy and Surgical Club","Clinical Case Presentation Forum","Bioethics Committee"],"culturalClubs":["Chords - Music Club","Footloose - Dance Crew","Fine Arts and Photography Club","SRM Theater Society","Literary & Quizzing Club"],"communityService":["NSS Medical Unit","SRM Rural Health Mission","Blood Donation Core Team","Preventive Healthcare Drives","School Health Education Programs","Disaster Relief Medical Team"]}'),
