 Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, ensures students receive rigorous theoretical instruction alongside practical training.\\n\\nThe campus is equipped with modernized laboratories, smart classrooms, and a well-stocked library to support comprehensive academic growth. The institution focuses heavily on practical skill development, partnering with prominent local and regional hospitals for continuous clinical rotations and internships. The dedicated faculty comprises seasoned healthcare practitioners and academicians who guide students through the complexities of modern medical technology and patient care.\\n\\nMaria College is committed to molding empathetic, highly competent, and disciplined healthcare workers. Beyond academics, the college promotes participation in health awareness camps, seminars, and community service, ensuring students understand the social responsibilities inherent in the medical profession. With growing placement networks, graduates successfully secure roles in diagnostic centers, corporate hospitals, and research facilities across the state.","highlights":["Serene, pollution-free campus in Kanniyakumari","Strong clinical tie-ups with regional hospitals","Dedicated skill laboratories for paramedical training","Highly qualified and experienced faculty","Continuous medical education and workshops","Active placement cell with growing industry links","Value-added courses in life support and ethics","Affordable education with transparent fee structure","Focus on holistic student development","Transport facilities covering major nearby towns"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anesthesia Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Medical Laboratory Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Radiography & Imaging Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Cardiac Technology","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-