ized fields like Clinical Embryology and Operation Theatre Technology. It operates in strict affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University.\\n\\nThe educational wing operates directly within the hospital premises, offering students an unparalleled, immersive clinical experience. Students are trained by leading gynecologists, embryologists, and neonatologists, working with state-of-the-art IVF labs, advanced neonatal ICUs, and modern surgical theaters. The curriculum is intensively practical, designed to produce specialists capable of handling complex procedures in reproductive medicine and maternal care.\\n\\nGraduates from the Womens Center are in exceptionally high demand, particularly in the rapidly expanding field of fertility and reproductive medicine. The institution prides itself on maintaining high academic standards, ethical clinical practices, and fostering a supportive, research-oriented environment. Students also benefit from participating in national conferences and workshops hosted by the hospital regularly.","highlights":["Niche focus on reproductive medicine and women''s health","Hands-on training in advanced IVF and ICSI laboratories","Direct mentoring by top embryologists and gynecologists","100% placement assistance in leading fertility clinics","Exposure to high-risk pregnancy and NICU care","State-of-the-art operation theatre complexes","Exclusive and focused student batches","Regular CMEs and fertility workshops","NABH accredited hospital environment","Located in the heart of Coimbatore city"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Clinical Reproduction & Embryology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anesthesia Technology","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Specialized Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"IVF Lab Training"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Clinical Exposure"},{"icon":"ti-pulse","name":"NICU Training Base"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Conference Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Research Wing"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":98,"avgPackage":"4.0 LPA","highestPackage":"6.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application Review","desc":"Candidates submit their applications detailing their academic performance in +2 Science stream."},{"title":"Merit Screening","desc":"Strict merit-based screening focusing on biology and chemistry scores due to the specialized nature of the courses."},{"title":"Personal Interview","desc":"A personal interview with the panel of doctors to gauge the candidate''s interest in reproductive medicine and maternal care."},{"title":"Medical Fitness Test","desc":"Basic health clearance is required to work in sterile lab environments (like IVF labs)."},{"title":"Final Admission","desc":"Selected candidates process their fees and submit original certificates for university registration."}],"scholarships":["Women Empowerment Scholarship","Merit Scholarship for Top Performers","Government First Graduate Fee Concession","SC/ST Educational Grant","Institutional Financial Aid for Deserving Students"],"events":["National Embryology Conference","Safe Motherhood Awareness Week","PCOS Awareness Campaign","Breast Cancer Screening Drive","Annual CME on Fetal Medicine","World Prematurity Day"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Coimbatore International Airport (14 km)","railway":"Coimbatore North Junction (2 km)","bustand":"Gandhipuram Central Bus Stand (3 km)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"Womens Center Hospital (On Campus)"},"hostelFeatures":["Safe and secure accommodation for female students","Proximity to the hospital block","Nutritious, hygienically prepared meals","Wi-Fi connectivity in rooms","24-hour security and CCTV surveillance","Laundry facilities available","Recreat