ity and recognized by the National Medical Commission (NMC), the institution offers comprehensive undergraduate (MBBS), postgraduate (MD/MS), and paramedical programs designed to nurture competent healthcare professionals.\\n\\nSpanning across a lush green 35-acre campus, SMIMS is equipped with state-of-the-art infrastructure, advanced laboratories, a well-stocked central library, and a multi-specialty teaching hospital that caters to the diverse medical needs of the rural and urban population in the region. The college emphasizes rigorous clinical training, evidence-based learning, and community health initiatives to mold well-rounded medical practitioners.\\n\\nWith a team of highly experienced and dedicated faculty members, the institution fosters an environment of continuous research, innovation, and ethical medical practice. Students are actively encouraged to participate in national conferences, research projects, and health camps, ensuring they stay at the forefront of modern medical science.","highlights":["Approved by the National Medical Commission (NMC)","Affiliated with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Attached Multi-Specialty Teaching Hospital with 600+ beds","Experienced and highly qualified medical faculty","Advanced diagnostic and research laboratories","Comprehensive central library with digital access","Separate hostel facilities for boys and girls","Active participation in rural health camps and community outreach","Regular CME programs and national level workshops","Excellent clinical exposure through high patient inflow"],"departments":[{"name":"Anatomy","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physiology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Biochemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Pathology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Pharmacology","level":"PG"},{"name":"General Medicine","level":"PhD"},{"name":"General Surgery","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Paediatrics","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"ic