 2014 as a Christian educational self-financing institution exclusively for women. It is managed by the Franciscan Sisters of the Immaculate Heart of Mary, a Catholic religious congregation founded by Rev. Fr. Louis Savinien Dupuis in Pondicherry in 1844. The institution began its academic journey in 2015 with 198 students, 10 teaching staff, 8 non-teaching staff and five undergraduate programmes at its temporary campus in Pudupalayam, Cuddalore.\\n\\nThe college subsequently developed its present campus at Chinnakanganankuppam, spread across approximately 9 acres. The institution currently reports 2,050 students and 77 teaching faculty members and offers 11 undergraduate and 5 postgraduate programmes. Its infrastructure includes spacious academic buildings, green campus areas, playground facilities, laboratories, an air-conditioned high-tech computer laboratory with internet access, canteen, seminar hall, auditorium and career guidance facilities. The college also maintains academic departments in Tamil, English, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Computer Science, BCA, Data Science, Commerce, BBA and Botany.","highlights":["Established in 2014","Catholic Minority Institution","Exclusively for Women","Managed by Franciscan Sisters of the Immaculate Heart of Mary","9-Acre Campus","2,050 Students","77 Teaching Faculty","11 Undergraduate Programmes","5 Postgraduate Programmes","Air-Conditioned High-Tech Computer Laboratory","Career Guidance and Placement Cell","Student-Centric Value-Based Education"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"UG"},{"name":"English","level":"UG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"BCA","level":"UG"},{"name":"Data Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"UG"},{"name":"BBA","level":"UG"},{"name":"Botany","level":"UG"},{"name":"Arts and Humanities","level":"PG"},{"name":"Science Programmes","level":"PG"},{"name":"Commerce Programmes","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Applications","level":"PG"},{"name":"Management Studies","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Internet Facility"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"High-Tech Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Modern Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-building","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-cup","name":"Canteen"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Ground"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Health Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Career Guidance Cell"}],"placementRate":"Active","avgPackage":"Developing","highestPackage":"Developing","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application","desc":"Applications are issued through the college admission process. The college states that UG applications cost ₹200 and PG applications cost ₹300."},{"title":"Eligibility Check","desc":"Applicants must satisfy the eligibility requirements prescribed for the selected programme and the affiliating university."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Students submit the completed application with the required academic certificates and supporting documents."},{"title":"Department Guidance","desc":"The college provides guidance to students and parents in choosing suitable departments."},{"title":"Selection","desc":"Selected students are informed through SMS and the selected list is displayed by the college."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"The selected candidate completes the prescribed fee payment and admission formalities within the stipulated period."}],"scholarships":["Tamil Nadu Government Scholarships","Post Matric Scholarship","Minority Scholarship","SC / ST Scholarship","BC / MBC Scholarship","First Graduate Scholarship","Merit Support","Government Student Welfare Schemes"],"events":["Freshers Day","Student Union Inauguration","Wo