an-College-Marthandam_44_11zon-300x286.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Nesamony Memorial Christian College - CollegeShine","description":"Nesamony Memorial Christian College is a private arts & science college in Marthandam established in 1964. Light and Truth Through Dedicated Learning Check.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Nesamony-Memorial-Christian-College-Marthandam_44_11zon-300x286.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Nesamony Memorial Christian College","shortName":"NMCC","tagline":"Light and Truth Through Dedicated Learning","category":"arts-science","type":"Aided Private College","ownership":"Private","established":1964,"location":"Marthandam","district":"Kanniyakumari","address":"Marthandam, Kanniyakumari District, Tamil Nadu, 629165","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Nesamony+Memorial+Christian+College+Marthandam","mapQuery":"Nesamony Memorial Christian College Marthandam","website":"https://www.nmcc.ac.in","phone":"04651-272059","email":"principal@nmcc.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Nesamony-Memorial-Christian-College-Marthandam_44_11zon-300x286.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9o0Whp-EZNo?si=3r82ieokNVignTf-","affiliation":"Manonmaniam Sundaranar University","accreditation":["NAAC Grade A","AICTE Approved MBA & MCA","Manonmaniam Sundaranar University","UGC Recognized 2(f) & 12(B)"],"about":"Nesamony Memorial Christian College (NMCC), situated in Marthandam, Kanniyakumari District, is a prestigious co-educational institution established in 1964. Managed by the Kanniyakumari Diocese of the Church of South India, NMCC stands as a towering beacon of higher learning in southern Tamil Nadu. Over its rich history spanning more than six decades, the college has earned widespread acclaim, historically achieving top-tier NAAC accreditation and consistently securing high national rankings. Affiliated with Manonmaniam Sundaranar University, the sprawling 32-acre campus houses state-of-the-art research facilities, extensive sports complexes, an indoor stadium, and a magnificent central library.\\n\\nThe institution offers a wide spectrum of undergraduate, postgraduate, professional (MBA, MCA), and doctoral research programs. Committed to holistic excellence, NMCC emphasizes rigorous academic scholarship, moral fortitude, and active community engagement. Its dedicated faculty and robust placement cell ensure that generations of students successfully transition into prominent careers across academia, corporate industries, public services, and research sectors globally.","highlights":["Established in 1964 with over 60 years of academic distinction","Sprawling 32-acre green campus equipped with world-class facilities","NAAC Re-accredited with Grade A rating","Active research centers offering Ph.D. programs across 12 departments","Offers professional programs including MBA and MCA","Magnificent indoor stadium, gymnasium, and expansive sports grounds","Extensive library with digital databases and rare manuscripts","Active placement cell with leading multi-national recruiters","Strong alumni network holding prominent global positions","Comprehensive student support and counseling cells"],"departments":[{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany and Biotechnology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Science & Applications","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Management Studies (MBA)","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":82,"avgPackage":"3.6 LPA","highestPackage":"7.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Online Registration","desc":"Candidates submit their applications online via the college portal for aided, self-supporting, or professional streams."},{"title":"Entrance & Merit Assessment","desc":"Admissions to MBA/MCA require valid TANCET/CAT/MAT scores, while UG/PG courses follow state merit norms."},{"title":"Certificate Verification","desc":"Provisionally selected candidates undergo physical verification of mark sheets, community certificates, and testimonials."},{"title":"Interview & Counseling","desc":"Personal interaction with the admission committee and faculty counselors to finalize academic tracks."},{"title":"Final Admission","desc":"Payment of fees and university registration to formalize enrollment."}],"scholarships":["CSI Diocese Educational Grants","State Government Backward Classes Scholarship","SC/ST/SCC Post-Matric Concessions","National Merit Scholarship Schemes","First Graduate Fee Reimbursement","Blind and Physically Challenged Welfare Grants","Merit Awards for University Rank Holders","Ex-Servicemen Dependants Scholarship"],"events":["Nesamony Trophy Inter-Collegiate Athletic Meet","National Science Day Symposia","Annual Cultural Fest - Fiesta","Management Fest - Conclave","Alumni Global Meet","Extension and Village Adoption Camps"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Trivandrum International Airport - 50 km","railway":"Marthandam Railway Station - 2 km","bustand":"Marthandam Bus Stand - 1 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"Government Taluk Hospital Marthandam - 1.5 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Secure hostel facili