ues and ethical principles, the college has grown into a premier centre of learning in the Tenkasi-Tirunelveli belt. Spanning across a sprawling green campus, the institution boasts robust infrastructure, advanced science laboratories, computer centers, and a comprehensive library housing thousands of volumes.\\n\\nThe academic offerings span a comprehensive array of undergraduate, postgraduate, and research programs across arts, science, and commerce domains. The faculty comprises highly qualified and dedicated academicians who focus on fostering critical inquiry, practical proficiency, and moral integrity. Regular seminars, workshops, and inter-collegiate competitions keep students engaged in contemporary developments across academic disciplines.\\n\\nDeeply rooted in community service, the college actively encourages student participation in national service programs, church outreach initiatives, sports tournaments, and cultural societies. With an active placement cell facilitating regular recruitment drives with premier corporate firms, CSI Jeyaraj Annapackiam College successfully prepares its graduates for bright professional careers and meaningful societal contributions.","highlights":["Renowned co-educational institution managed by the CSI Tirunelveli Diocese","Spacious 25-acre green campus with state-of-the-art infrastructural facilities","Experienced faculty with active publication and research credentials","Well-equipped laboratories and advanced computing infrastructure","Strong career guidance and placement cell with high corporate placement records","Extensive central library with digital database access","Active student clubs, NSS, YRC, and spiritual fellowship units","Separate residential hostels for male and female students with modern amenities","Extensive sports grounds supporting cricket, football, and athletics","Scholarship schemes and financial aid for deserving rural students"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","l