('duraimurugan-college-of-education','duraimurugan-college-of-education','Durai Murugan College of Education','DMCE','teacher-education','Private','Private Trust','2007','Vellore','Vellore','Chittoor Main Road, Katpadi, Vellore, Tamil Nadu - 632059','https://maps.google.com/?q=Durai+Murugan+College+of+Education+Vellore','https://bed.kingston.ac.in/','04162298346','info.bed@kingston.ac.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Durai-Murugan-College-of-Education-collegshine_11_11zon.webp','Durai Murugan College of Education | Vellore - CollegeShine','Durai Murugan College of Education is a private trust teacher education college in Vellore established in 2007. Moulding character, shaping careers, and.',NULL, '{"id":"duraimurugan-college-of-education","seo":{"metaTitle":"Durai Murugan College of Education | Vellore - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Durai Murugan College of Education is a private trust teacher education college in Vellore established in 2007. Moulding character, shaping careers, and.","metaKeywords":["Durai Murugan College of Education","DMCE","Durai Murugan College of Education admission 2026","Durai Murugan College of Education fees","Durai Murugan College of Education courses","Teacher Education colleges in Vellore","Vellore","Teacher Education","Private Trust","Private","NCTE","Thiruvalluvar University","Government of Tamil Nadu","NAAC Accredited","Bachelor of Education (B.Ed)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Durai Murugan College of Education","openGraph":{"title":"Durai Murugan College of Education | Vellore - CollegeShine","description":"Durai Murugan College of Education is a private trust teacher education college in Vellore established in 2007. Moulding character, shaping careers, and.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Durai-Murugan-College-of-Education-collegshine_11_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Durai Murugan College of Education | Vellore - CollegeShine","description":"Durai Murugan College of Education is a private trust teacher education college in Vellore established in 2007. Moulding character, shaping careers, and.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Durai-Murugan-College-of-Education-collegshine_11_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Durai Murugan College of Education","shortName":"DMCE","tagline":"Moulding character, shaping careers, and educating future generations","category":"teacher-education","type":"Private","ownership":"Private Trust","established":2007,"location":"Vellore","district":"Vellore","address":"Chittoor Main Road, Katpadi, Vellore, Tamil Nadu - 632059","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Durai+Murugan+College+of+Education+Vellore","mapQuery":"Durai Murugan College of Education Vellore","website":"https://bed.kingston.ac.in/","phone":"04162298346","email":"info.bed@kingston.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Durai-Murugan-College-of-Education-collegshine_11_11zon.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"Thiruvalluvar University","accreditation":["NCTE","Thiruvalluvar University","Government of Tamil Nadu","NAAC Accredited"],"about":"Durai Murugan College of Education, located in Katpadi, Vellore, is a premier institution dedicated to cultivating exceptional educators. Established in 2007 under the aegis of the Duraimurugan Education and Charitable Trust, the college is approved by the National Council for Teacher Education (NCTE) and affiliated with Thiruvalluvar University. Set across a sprawling 10-acre green campus, the institution provides an enriching environment focused on academic rigor, pedagogical skill development, and holistic personal growth.\\n\\nThe college offers a comprehensive Bachelor of Education (B.Ed) program designed to blend modern instructional methodologies with foundational educational theories. Experienced faculty members mentor teacher-trainees through immersive classroom learning, micro-teaching sessions, and structured internships at reputed partner schools across Vellore district. State-of-the-art facilities, including well-equipped science and computer laboratories, a comprehensive library, and vibrant sports grounds, ensure that students receive a well-rounded training experience.\\n\\nCommitted to fostering moral values, social responsibility, and professional excellence, Durai Murugan College of Education continues to supply competent, compassionate, and visionary teachers to modern classrooms. The institution emphasizes critical thinking, digital literacy in education, and community engagement, preparing graduates to navigate and excel in contemporary academic landscapes.","highlights":["Approved by NCTE and affiliated with Thiruvalluvar University","Spacious 10-acre serene campus equipped with modern infrastructure","Dedicated faculty with extensive research and pedagogical expertise","Comprehensive practical training and school internship programs","Advanced educational technology and computer lab facilities","Active placement and career guidance cell for aspiring teachers","Regular organization of national seminars, workshops, and cultural events","Robust library stocked with thousands of reference books and journals","Strong emphasis on co-curricular activities, sports, and community outreach","Affordable fee structure aligned with state norms for quality teacher education"],"departments":[{"name":"Bachelor of Education (B.Ed)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":85,"avgPackage":"2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"4.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Eligibility Check","desc":"Candidates must possess a graduation or postgraduate degree in arts, science, or engineering with a minimum of 50% aggregate marks."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Fill out the application form available online through the college portal or offline at the campus admission office."},{"title":"Merit Determination","desc":"Selections are strictly based on merit, considering marks secured in the qualifying degree examination as per TN Government rules."},{"title":"Counselling Session","desc":"Shortlisted candidates participate in document verification and counseling conducted by the admission committee."},{"title":"Final Enrollment","desc":"Pay the prescribed tuition fees to confirm admission and secure enrollment into the B.Ed program."}],"scholarships":["First Graduate Tuition Fee Concession","Post Matric Scholarship for SC/ST Students","BC/MBC State Government Scholarship","Minority Welfare Scholarship","Differently Abled Student Financial Assistance","Ex-Servicemen Ward Educational Concession","Merit-Based Institutional Waiver","Trust Endowment Awards for Toppers"],"events":["Annual Sports Meet","Teacher''s Day Celebrations","National Science Day Exhibition","Annual Cultural Fest - Utsav","Pedagogical Workshop Series","Community Health and Literacy Camp"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"130 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"7 km (Katpadi Junction)","bustand":"6 km (Vellore New Bus Stand)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"3 km (CMI Hospital Katpadi)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate accommodation for men and women","24/7 Security and CCTV surveillance","Wi-Fi connectivity across hostel blocks","Nutritious vegetarian and non-vegetarian mess food","Re