ckgrounds.\\n\\nThe college offers comprehensive teacher-training programmes including Bachelor of Education (B.Ed.), Master of Education (M.Ed.), and M.Phil. in Education. Over the years, Siga College of Education has built a robust reputation for academic excellence, disciplined training methodologies, and holistic student development. The infrastructure includes well-ventilated classrooms, advanced psychology and educational technology laboratories, a richly stocked central library, and dedicated spaces for sports and cultural activities.\\n\\nWith a team of experienced and committed faculty members, the institution emphasizes interactive teaching, micro-teaching practices, personality development, and ethical grounding. Regular workshops, seminars, community outreach programs via NSS, and comprehensive placement assistance ensure that graduates step out as competent, confident, and socially responsible torchbearers of modern education.","highlights":["Approved by NCTE and affiliated with Tamil Nadu Teachers Education University","Accredited with NAAC B+ Grade ensuring high educational standards","Serene 10.06-acre rural campus providing an ideal academic atmosphere","Dedicated educational technology and psychology laboratories","Well-stocked library housing over 12,000 academic titles and journals","Separate residential facilities for boys and girls within the campus","Active placement cell organizing regular campus recruitment drives","Strong emphasis on micro-teaching, communication skills, and pedagogy","Engaged student community through NSS and regular community services","Regular guest lectures, seminars, and inter-collegiate competitions"],"departments":[{"name":"Bachelor of Education (B.Ed)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Master of Education (M.Ed)","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Phil in Education","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-b