galam - CollegeShine","description":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam is a government arts & science college in Vettukadu, Sendamangalam established in 2017. Bringing higher.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/government-arts-science-college-sendamangalam-1.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam - CollegeShine","description":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam is a government arts & science college in Vettukadu, Sendamangalam established in 2017. Bringing higher.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/government-arts-science-college-sendamangalam-1.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam","shortName":"GASC Sendamangalam","tagline":"Bringing higher education to the Kolli Hills foothills since 2017","category":"arts-science","type":"Degree College","ownership":"Government","established":2017,"location":"Vettukadu, Sendamangalam","district":"Namakkal","address":"Government Arts and Science College, Vettukadu Post, Sendamangalam Taluk, Namakkal District - 637409, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Government+Arts+and+Science+College+Sendamangalam","mapQuery":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam, Namakkal, Tamil Nadu 637409","website":"https://www.gascsdm.in/","phone":"04286-271489","email":"prucassendamangalam@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/government-arts-science-college-sendamangalam-1.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["Government of Tamil Nadu Recognized","Periyar University Affiliated","UGC Recognized Institution"],"about":"Government Arts and Science College, Sendamangalam was established on 25