 is co-educational, affiliated to Periyar University, Salem, accredited by NAAC with an A grade, recognized by the UGC, approved by AICTE, and is ISO 9001:2008 certified.\\n\\nSituated on Attur Main Road in Ramalingapuram, Salem, the college offers 29 courses across five academic streams — Arts, Science, IT, Commerce and Banking, and Management — including popular programmes such as BSc, B.Com, BBA, BA, and BCA, along with newer offerings like B.Sc. in Forensic Science, B.Sc. in Computer Science (Artificial Intelligence and Data Science), and B.Sc. in Textiles and Fashion Designing. According to the college''s own promotional materials, it has provided over 1,300 job offers to students across several consecutive years, with recruiters reported to include TCS, Wipro, Cognizant, Infosys, HCL, and Capgemini; these figures are self-reported and not independently verified. The campus hosts student clubs including a Literary Club, Science Club, Commerce Association, and Cultural Club.","highlights":["NAAC A grade and ISO 9001:2008 certified","29 courses across 5 academic streams","Self-reported 1,300+ job offers over 7 consecutive years","Offers newer specializations like Forensic Science and AI & Data Science"],"departments":[{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"}],"facilities":["Library","Cafeteria","Hostel","Computer Labs"],"placementRate":3.9,"avgPackage":"₹2.7 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5.5LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":["Merit-based admission using Class 12 marks for UG","Graduation from a recognized university required for PG"],"scholarships":["Scholarships for meritorious and financially disadvantaged students"],"events":["''Singa Pennae – Athiradai Padai'' women empowerment program on July 10, 2026, the 28th Graduation Day on