 and Science College is an autonomous private self-financing institution located at Sathyamangalam in Erode District, Tamil Nadu. The foundation stone of the institution was laid under the leadership of Shri S.V. Balasubramaniam, Chairman of Bannari Amman Institute of Technology, and the institution was formally opened on 5 July 2001. The college is situated on an extensive 25-acre green campus with well-equipped laboratories, ventilated classrooms, library resources and sports facilities.\\n\\nThe college is affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore and is recognized by the UGC under Sections 2(f) and 12(B). It is accredited with an A Grade by NAAC. The institution provides undergraduate and postgraduate education across commerce, management, science, computer applications, languages and related disciplines, with emphasis on skill development, ICT-enabled learning, mentoring, research and career preparation. Its Placement and Training Cell conducts pre-placement training, aptitude and communication training, mock interviews, campus drives, pool drives, career counselling and industry-oriented activities.","highlights":["25-Acre Green Campus","Established in 2001","NAAC A Grade Accredited","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) Recognized","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","Autonomous Institution","ICT-Enabled Learning","Modern Laboratories","Digital Learning Resources","Placement and Training Cell","Skill Development Programmes","Industry and Institutional Collaborations"],"departments":[{"name":"BBA Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Information Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Artificial Intelligence and Data Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Costume Design and Fashion","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com Commerce","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com Professional Accounting","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com Computer Applications","level":"U