ge places immense emphasis on skill enhancement, leadership training, and placements through a dedicated career guidance cell. With robust industry connections and active student clubs, Anna Adarsh College for Women continues to shape independent, empowered women leaders of tomorrow.","highlights":["Re-accredited by NAAC at A++ Grade with CGPA 3.59","Autonomous status conferring academic flexibility","Comprehensive infrastructure with advanced ICT tools","Active placement cell with top-tier corporate recruiters","Vibrant student clubs and extension activities like NSS and NCC","Well-stocked automated central library with digital repository","Experienced and highly qualified faculty members","Regular guest lectures, workshops, and national seminars","Robust mentorship and remedial coaching systems","Strong alumni network occupying prominent global positions"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Com General","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English Literature","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A.","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":88,"avgPackage":"4.2 LPA","highestPackage":"12.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Candidates must submit online applications through the official college portal following the release of qualifying exam results."},{"title":"Merit Preparation","desc":"Selections are strictly based on merit calculated from marks secured in the higher sec