oma in Pharmacy)","B.Pharm (Bachelor of Pharmacy)","M.Pharm — Pharmaceutics","M.Pharm — Pharmaceutical Analysis","Pharm.D (Doctor of Pharmacy)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of Pharmacy","openGraph":{"title":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of - CollegeShine","description":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of Pharmacy is a private pharmacy college in Thiruninravur, Chennai (Tiruvallur District) established in 2001.","image":"https://jayagc.org/image/logo/trustLogo.png","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of - CollegeShine","description":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of Pharmacy is a private pharmacy college in Thiruninravur, Chennai (Tiruvallur District) established in 2001.","image":"https://jayagc.org/image/logo/trustLogo.png"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Jaya College of Paramedical Sciences, College of Pharmacy","shortName":"Jaya College of Pharmacy","tagline":"Admit, Acquire, Achieve — Building the Brick of Youth","category":"pharmacy","type":"Private Self-Financing College","ownership":"Private","established":2001,"location":"Thiruninravur, Chennai (Tiruvallur District)","district":"Tiruvallur","address":"CTH Road, Thiruninravur, Chennai - 602024, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3885.6230508148324!2d80.04423051482362!3d13.123049690756648!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a526417e979e24d%3A0x3ac8be787a834d23!2sJaya+College+of+Pharmacy!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1556097138523!5m2!1sen!2sin","mapQuery":"Jaya+College+of+Pharmacy+Thiruninravur+Chennai","website":"https://jcp.edu.in","phone":"044-29038239","email":"mailto:info@jce.edu.in","image":"https://jayagc.org/image/logo/trustLogo.png","videoUrl":"","af