ion":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai; functioning under the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Government of Tamil Nadu","accreditation":["Government Institution under DME, Tamil Nadu","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","Recognized — Degrees Granted On or After February 2018"],"about":"Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College and Hospital (GTMCH) is a government medical college operated by the Government of Tamil Nadu, situated on the Thiruvannamalai Outer Ring Road in Vengikkal New Town, Thirinjapuram Union, Thiruvannamalai district. The college emerged from the transfer of the 440-bed Tiruvannamalai Government District Headquarters Hospital — which began as a Taluk hospital in 1950 — to the Department of Medical Education on 1 April 2012. It was relaunched as a teaching hospital offering 100 undergraduate MBBS seats, with the first batch commencing studies in the 2013–2014 academic year.\\n\\nThe college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai and is recognized for degrees granted on or after February 2018. Spread over 35.44 acres, the college offers MBBS along with postgraduate programmes in MD Paediatrics and MS Obstetrics & Gynaecology. The hospital''s clinical departments include Medicine and Surgery (120 beds across 4 units), Obstetrics & Gynaecology, Paediatrics and Orthopaedics (60 beds across 2 units), Chest Medicine, Ophthalmology and ENT (20 beds), and Dermatology and Psychiatry (20 beds), along with attached Primary Health Centres for rural and urban health training.","highlights":["100 MBBS Seats — Government Medical College","35.44-Acre Campus","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","MD Paediatrics & MS Obstetrics and Gynaecology Postgraduate Courses","Separate Boys & Girls Hostels — 250 Rooms","Central Library with 7,014 Books & 100 Journals","Attached Rural & Urban Health Training Centres","Emerged from 440-Bed District Headquarters Hospital (Est. 1950)"],"departments":[{"name":"MBBS","level":"UG"},{"name":"MD Paediatrics","level":"PG"},{"name":"MS Obstetrics and Gynaecology","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Internet & MEDLAR Facility (25 Nodes)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical & Non-Clinical Departments"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Hostels (250 Rooms)"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"440-Bed Multi-Department Hospital"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports — Cricket, Volleyball, Badminton, Gymnasium"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Examination Hall (250 sqm)"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"5 Lecture Theatres"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Rural & Urban Health Training Centres"}],"placementRate":"data not available","avgPackage":"data not available","highestPackage":"data not available","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Qualify NEET UG","desc":"Candidates must qualify NEET UG with the required aggregate for admission to MBBS."},{"title":"Register for Tamil Nadu / All India Counselling","desc":"Apply through Tamil Nadu state medical counselling or the All India Quota (AIQ) counselling process as applicable."},{"title":"Choice Filling","desc":"Select Government Thiruvannamalai Medical College during the choice-filling process."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats allotted based on NEET rank and category reservation."},{"title":"Reporting & Bond Signing","desc":"Report to the college with original documents; MBBS admission includes a compulsory rural service bond of 5 years (penalty ₹5,00,000 if skipped)."}],"scholarships":[],"events":[],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"85 km (Katpadi) / 180 km (Chennai)","railway":"7.7 km","bustand":"4.8 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","250 Rooms","Internet Connection"],"technicalClubs":[],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["Rural Health Training Centre — Kattampoondi PHC (17 km)","Urban Health Training Centre — Municipal PHC (7 km)"]}'),
('college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd','college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD','NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy','occupational-therapy','National Institute (Central Government, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)','Government (Government of India)','2005','Muttukadu, Chennai','Chengalpattu','East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, Tamil Nadu (about 30 km from Chennai Central Railway Station, Mofussil Bus Terminus and Airport)','https://maps.google.com/?q=NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai','https://niepmd.nic.in/bot/','9444314716','mailto:niepmd@nic.in','https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine','College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.',NULL, '{"id":"college-of-occupational-therapy-niepmd","seo":{"metaTitle":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","metaKeywords":["College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD","NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD admission 2026","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD fees","College of Occupational Therapy","NIEPMD courses","Occupational Therapy colleges in Chengalpattu","Muttukadu","Chennai","Chengalpattu","Occupational Therapy","Government (Government of India)","National Institute (Central Government","Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Chennai","Under Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan)","Govt. of India","NAAC Accredited (Institute-Level)","B.O.T (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD","openGraph":{"title":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","description":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD - CollegeShine","description":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD is a government (government of india) occupational therapy college in Muttukadu, Chennai established in 2005.","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"College of Occupational Therapy, NIEPMD","shortName":"NIEPMD — Occupational Therapy","tagline":"Empowering Persons with Multiple Disabilities","category":"occupational-therapy","type":"National Institute (Central Government, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment)","ownership":"Government (Government of India)","established":2005,"location":"Muttukadu, Chennai","district":"Chengalpattu","address":"East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, Tamil Nadu (about 30 km from Chennai Central Railway Station, Mofussil Bus Terminus and Airport)","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai","mapQuery":"NIEPMD+Muttukadu+Chennai","website":"https://niepmd.nic.in/bot/","phone":"9444314716","email":"mailto:niepmd@nic.in","image":"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s33837a451cd0abc5ce4069304c5442c87/uploads/2024/09/2024091260708867.png","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cqXKPB05fE?si=3V6X9wYDR4S9yFIA&amp;start=66","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai; functions under the Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan), Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment, Government of India","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai","Under Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan), Govt. of India","NAAC Accredited (Institute-Level)"],"about":"The College of Occupational Therapy functions under the National Institute for Empowerment of Persons with Multiple Disabilities (Divyangjan) (NIEPMD), established in 2005 on East Coast Road, Muttukadu, Chennai, under the Department of Empowerment of Persons with Disabilities, Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment, Government of India. NIEPMD serves as a national resource centre for the empowerment of persons with multiple disabilities, covering conditions enumerated under the RPWD Act (2016) and The National Trust Act (1999), including Autism, Cerebral Palsy, Intellectual Disability, and Multiple Disabilities including deafblindness.\\n\\nThe Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (B.O.T) programme is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University, Chennai, and runs as a 4-academic-year programme followed by a 6-month compulsory internship, in a non-semester pattern. Admission is through the Common Entrance Test (CET) for the All India Quota and through counselling conducted by the Directorate of Medical Education, Tamil Nadu for the State Quota, as approved by the Nodal Ministry. The programme trains occupational therapists across Paediatrics, Psychiatry, Geriatrics, Orthopaedics, Neurology, and Hand Rehabilitation, covering evaluation, therapeutic intervention, splinting and assistive device fabrication, activities-of-daily-living training, and environmental modification.","highlights":["Central Government National Institute — Ministry of Social Justice & Empowerment","B.O.T Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","4-Year Programme + 6-Month Compulsory Internship","Admission via CET (All India Quota) & DME Tamil Nadu Counselling (State Quota)","Training Across Paediatrics, Psychiatry, Geriatrics, Orthopaedics, Neurology & Hand Rehabilitation","National Resource Centre for Persons with Multiple Disabilities","NAAC Accredited Institute","On East Coast Road, ~30 km from Chennai Central & Airport"],"departments":[{"name":"B.O.T (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"NIEPMD Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical & Therapy Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Department of Medical Science"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Department of Therapeutics"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Department of Adult Independent Living"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports & Recreation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Halls"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Digital Learning Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Research & Development Wing"}],"placementRate":85,"avgPackage":"₹3.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹6 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates from all categories must have passed Higher Secondary (H.Sc) or equivalent with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology/Botany & Zoology."},{"title":"All India Quota — Common Entrance Test (CET)","desc":"Candidates applying under the All India Quota must appear for and qualify the CET conducted by NIEPMD."},{"title":"State Quota — DME Tamil Nadu Counselling","desc":"Candidates applying under the Tamil Nadu State Quota go through counselling conducted by the Directorate of Medical Education (DME), Tamil Nadu."},{"title":"Document Verification & Seat Allotment","desc":"Complete document verification; seats are allotted based on merit, with reservation for SC/ST/OBC/PwD and others as per Government norms."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to NIEPMD with original documents for final enrollment into the B.O.T programme."}],"scholarships":["Reservation & Fee Concession for SC/ST/OBC/PwD Candidates (as per Government of India norms)"],"events":["International Day of Yoga","World Autism Awareness Day","Helen Keller Birth Anniversary Celebration","CRE Webinars","Conferences","Purple Fair (Disability Awareness & Inclusion Event)"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"30 km","railway":"30 km","bustand":"30 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus (Dept. of Medical Science)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Mess Facility","Wi-Fi Facility","24x7 Security"],"technicalClubs":["Occupational Therapy Research Club","Assistive Device Innovation Cell","Clinical Skill Development Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Flagship Programme for SC/ST Project","Flagship Programme — North East Project","Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) Initiatives","Community Awareness & Outreach for Persons with Disabilities"]}'),
('krishna-college-of-paramedical-and-allied-health-science-occupational-therapy','krishna-college-of-paramedical-and-allied-health-science-occupational-therapy','Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy','Krishna College (Occupational Therapy)','occupational-therapy','Private Paramedical & Allied Health Sciences College','Private (Ramakrishnan Education and Charities Trust)','2018','Samayapuram, Trichy','Tiruchirappalli','Kottaimedu, Samayapuram, Manachanallur Taluk, Trichy - 621105, Tamil Nadu, India','https://maps.google.com/?q=Krishna+College+of+Paramedical+and+Allied+Health+Science+Trichy','http://krishnaparamc.com/','0431-2232696, +91-7598844696','mailto:info@krishnaparamc.com','http://krishnaparamc.com/images/krichna-EI.jpg','Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health - CollegeShine','Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy is a private (ramakrishnan education and charities trust) occupational therapy college in.',NULL, '{"id":"krishna-college-of-paramedical-and-allied-health-science-occupational-therapy","seo":{"metaTitle":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy is a private (ramakrishnan education and charities trust) occupational therapy college in.","metaKeywords":["Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science","Trichy","Krishna College (Occupational Therapy)","Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science","Trichy admission 2026","Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science","Trichy fees","Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science","Trichy courses","Occupational Therapy colleges in Tiruchirappalli","Samayapuram","Trichy","Tiruchirappalli","Occupational Therapy","Private (Ramakrishnan Education and Charities Trust)","Private Paramedical & Allied Health Sciences College","Approved by Government of Tamil Nadu (G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Ragging-Free Campus","BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy","openGraph":{"title":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health - CollegeShine","description":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy is a private (ramakrishnan education and charities trust) occupational therapy college in.","image":"http://krishnaparamc.com/images/krichna-EI.jpg","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health - CollegeShine","description":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy is a private (ramakrishnan education and charities trust) occupational therapy college in.","image":"http://krishnaparamc.com/images/krichna-EI.jpg"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science, Trichy","shortName":"Krishna College (Occupational Therapy)","tagline":"Quality Education with Expert Faculties","category":"occupational-therapy","type":"Private Paramedical & Allied Health Sciences College","ownership":"Private (Ramakrishnan Education and Charities Trust)","established":2018,"location":"Samayapuram, Trichy","district":"Tiruchirappalli","address":"Kottaimedu, Samayapuram, Manachanallur Taluk, Trichy - 621105, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Krishna+College+of+Paramedical+and+Allied+Health+Science+Trichy","mapQuery":"Krishna+College+of+Paramedical+and+Allied+Health+Science+Trichy","website":"http://krishnaparamc.com/","phone":"0431-2232696, +91-7598844696","email":"mailto:info@krishnaparamc.com","image":"http://krishnaparamc.com/images/krichna-EI.jpg","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; approved by the Government of Tamil Nadu vide G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018","accreditation":["Approved by Government of Tamil Nadu (G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Ragging-Free Campus"],"about":"Krishna College of Paramedical and Allied Health Science was started in the academic year 2018-2019 by the Ramakrishnan Education and Charities Trust. It is approved by the Government of Tamil Nadu vide G.O. (MS) No.344 Dt. 10.08.2018 and affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. Located at Kottaimedu, Samayapuram, near Trichy, the college offers Nursing, Paramedical, and Allied Health Science programmes, including the Bachelor of Occupational Therapy (BOT).\\n\\nThe BOT programme is a 5-year undergraduate course with an intake of 60 seats, designed to train students in occupational therapy across rehabilitation, multi-specialty hospital, and community health settings. Clinical training is supported through tie-ups with Sri Venkateswara Hospitals (the parent 150-bed multi-specialty hospital, 11 km from the college), Lalgudi Government Hospital (12 km away), and the 1,500-bed Mahatma Gandhi Memorial Government Hospital, Trichy. The campus features cross-ventilated classrooms with LCD projectors, a well-equipped library, a 34-computer lab, hostel facilities with 24x7 security, and a dedicated transport bus for students and staff.","highlights":["BOT — 5-Year Programme, 60 Seats","Approved by Govt. of Tamil Nadu (2018)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Clinical Tie-Ups with Sri Venkateswara Hospitals, Lalgudi Govt. Hospital & MGM Govt. Hospital Trichy","Cross-Ventilated LCD Classrooms — 60-Student Capacity Each","34-Computer Lab with Internet Access","Separate Hostel with 24x7 Security & Surveillance","Dedicated College Transport Bus","Ragging-Free Campus","Scholarships Available for Deserving Candidates"],"departments":[{"name":"BOT (Bachelor of Occupational Therapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Computer Lab with Internet (34 Computers)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library (1,065 Books, 15 Journals)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Anatomy & Clinical Skills Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"College Transport Bus (60-Seater)"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Training Hospitals"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Yoga Hall"},{"icon":"ti-shield","name":"24x7 Security & CCTV Surveillance"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"LCD Projector Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Nutrition Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Conference & Workshop Facilities"}],"placementRate":70,"avgPackage":"₹2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have passed +2 with Physics, Chemistry, Maths and Biology/Botany & Zoology, and be at least 17 years old at the time of admission."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Download and submit the college application form (available on the official website) for the relevant academic year."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Submit original academic and identity documents for verification at the college."},{"title":"Merit-Based Admission","desc":"Seats are allotted based on merit and eligibility as per college and university norms."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment and reporting formalities to confirm admission into the BOT programme."}],"scholarships":["Merit-Based Scholarships for Deserving Candidates (as mentioned on official site, specific schemes not detailed)"],"events":["Freshers'' Day","Annual College Day","Sports Meet","World Occupational Therapy Day","Clinical Skills Workshop"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"20 km","railway":"15 km","bustand":"12 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"11 km (Sri Venkateswara Hospitals — Parent Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostel","24x7 Security Guards","CCTV Surveillance","Medical Help Available","24-Hour Water Supply"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skill Development Club","Occupational Therapy Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Free Health Camps","Community Rehabilitation Outreach","Blood Donation Camps"]}'),
