ital Group)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Part of Kauvery Hospital Group (Sri Kauvery Medical Care India Ltd)","Training Adjacent to Multi-Speciality Kauvery Hospital","B.Sc. Cardiac Technology","B.Sc. Dialysis Technology","B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology","B.Sc. Physician Assistant"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli (Allied Health Sciences)","openGraph":{"title":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli - CollegeShine","description":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli (Allied Health Sciences) is a private (sri kauvery medical care india ltd — kauvery hospital group) allied.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kaveri-Medical-Centre-Hospital-Tiruchirappalli-Allied-Health-Sciences-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli - CollegeShine","description":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli (Allied Health Sciences) is a private (sri kauvery medical care india ltd — kauvery hospital group) allied.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kaveri-Medical-Centre-Hospital-Tiruchirappalli-Allied-Health-Sciences-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tiruchirappalli (Allied Health Sciences)","shortName":"Kaveri Medical Centre Trichy (AHS)","tagline":"Join Our Accredited Paramedical Programs","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Allied Health Sciences College (Kauvery Hospital Group)","ownership":"Private (Sri Kauvery Medical Care India Ltd — Kauvery Hospital Group)","established":1999,"location":"Tennur, Tiruchirappalli","district":"Tiruchirappalli","address":"No. 1 K.C. Road, Tennur, Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu - 620017","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Kaveri+Medical+Centre+and+Hospital+Tennur+Trichy","mapQuery":"Kaveri+Medical+Centre+and+Hospital+Tennur+Trichy","website":"https://www.kauveryhospital.com/paramedical-courses/","phone":"0431-4003500","email":"mailto:ramassamy@hotmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Kaveri-Medical-Centre-Hospital-Tiruchirappalli-Allied-Health-Sciences-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7YQuzw0Mk9U?si=Zin6gG6wynhwJyDr","affiliation":"B.Sc. Allied Health Sciences programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Part of Kauvery Hospital Group (Sri Kauvery Medical Care India Ltd)","Training Adjacent to Multi-Speciality Kauvery Hospital"],"about":"Kaveri Medical Centre & Hospital, Tennur, part of the Kauvery Hospital Group, offers Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) programmes in Allied Health Sciences in affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. The college trains students across four specializations: Cardiac Technology, Dialysis Technology, Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology, and Physician Assistant — each a 4-year programme requiring +2 in Pure Science or Maths with Biology.\\n\\nTraining takes place adjacent to the multi-speciality Kauvery Hospital, giving students hands-on clinical exposure across departments under experienced faculty and doctors. The college highlights a track record of 100% student results, with students having participated in and won awards at national-level conferences. Kauvery Hospital also runs seminars and webinars conducted by expert doctors and faculty as part of the learning experience, alongside a separate free, job-oriented one-year paramedical diploma initiative run in partnership with the Corporation of Chennai and Rotary Club of Madras East for underprivileged students.","highlights":["4 B.Sc. Allied Health Science Programmes — Cardiac Tech, Dialysis Tech, OT & Anaesthesia Tech, Physician Assistant","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Training Adjacent to Multi-Speciality Kauvery Hospital","100% Student Results (Official Claim)","Hands-On Clinical Training Across All Departments","Students Have Won Awards at National-Level Conferences","Regular Seminars & Webinars by Expert Doctors and Faculty","Part of the Kauvery Hospital Group"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc. Cardiac Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Dialysis Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Operation Theatre & Anaesthesia Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physician Assistant","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Hospital Network"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Allied Health Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Clinical Skill Labs"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Ambulance Services"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Multi-Speciality Hospital (Adjacent)"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement & Career Support"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Clinical Training Across Departments"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Seminar & Webinar Programs"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"National Conference Participation"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Experienced Faculty & Doctor-Led Training"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Student Award Recognition"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"₹2.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates must have completed +2 in Pure Science or Maths with Biology."},{"title":"Apply Online or In-Person","desc":"Submit the paramedical course application through the official Kauvery Hospital website or admissions office."},{"title":"Document Submission","desc":"Submit eligibility certificate (for non-TN Higher Secondary candidates), migration certificate (if applicable), and passport-size photographs."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Complete fee payment via the specified bank account to confirm the application."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college with original documents for final enrollment into the chosen B.Sc. Allied Health Science programme."}],"scholarships":["Free Job-Oriented Paramedical Diploma (Separate 1-Year Initiative for Underprivileged Students, in Partnership with Corporation of Chennai & Rotary Club of Madras East)"],"events":["National-Level Student Conferences","Seminars by Expert Doctors","Webinars","Award Ceremonies for Student Achievers"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"7 km (Tiruchirappalli International Airport)","railway":"3 km (Trichy Junction)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Site (Kauvery Hospital)"},"hostelFeatures":["Hostel Facility Available"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skills Development Club","Allied Health Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Hospital Cultural Events Committee"],"communityService":["Free Paramedical Diploma for Underprivileged Students (Chennai Corporation Partnership)","Health Awareness Camps"]}'),
('the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai','the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai','TSNA Chennai','allied-health-science','Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)','Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)','2010','St. Thomas Mount, Chennai','Chennai','Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, No.8, GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, Chennai - 600016','https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy/@13.0009773,80.1973177,17z','https://www.thesnacademy.ac.in/','044-4908 6000 (9:00 AM – 4:00 PM)','mailto:snacademy@snmail.org','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine','Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.',NULL, '{"id":"the-sankara-nethralaya-academy-chennai","seo":{"metaTitle":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","metaKeywords":["Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai","TSNA Chennai","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai admission 2026","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai fees","Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy)","Chennai courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Chennai","St. Thomas Mount","Chennai","Chennai","Allied Health Science","Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)","Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories (On-Campus)","NCAHP-Aligned Curriculum (BMLS & MMLS)","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","B.Tech - Aeronautical Engineering","B.Tech - Aerospace Engineering","B.Sc. Aviation Science","B.Sc. Avionics","B.Sc. Aircraft Maintenance"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai","openGraph":{"title":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","description":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara - CollegeShine","description":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai is a private (founded by late padma bhushan dr. s.s. badrinath — sankara nethralaya.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Medical Research Foundation (The Sankara Nethralaya Academy), Chennai","shortName":"TSNA Chennai","tagline":"Excellence in Optometry, Healthcare Management and Medical Laboratory Science","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Healthcare Education Institute (Academic Arm of Sankara Nethralaya / Medical Research Foundation)","ownership":"Private (Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath — Sankara Nethralaya Group)","established":2010,"location":"St. Thomas Mount, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, No.8, GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, Chennai - 600016","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy/@13.0009773,80.1973177,17z","mapQuery":"The+Sankara+Nethralaya+Academy+St+Thomas+Mount+Chennai","website":"https://www.thesnacademy.ac.in/","phone":"044-4908 6000 (9:00 AM – 4:00 PM)","email":"mailto:snacademy@snmail.org","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Sankara-Nethralaya-Medical-Research-Foundation-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; academic collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories (On-Campus)","NCAHP-Aligned Curriculum (BMLS & MMLS)","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science","Approved by NMC (MCI)"],"about":"The Sankara Nethralaya Academy (TSNA), Chennai, is the academic arm of the Medical Research Foundation / Sankara Nethralaya group, founded in 2010 by the late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath. Operating from the Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus on GST Road, St. Thomas Mount, TSNA offers globally aligned programmes in affiliation with The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and in academic collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science.\\n\\nTSNA is organised into three schools: the School of Optometry (Master of Optometry plus six clinical fellowship programmes and a certificate course in Occupational Optometry), the School of Management Studies (Master of Hospital Administration), and the School of Medical Laboratory Sciences (Bachelor and Master of Medical Laboratory Science, BMLS/MMLS, both NCAHP-aligned). A separate certificate programme in Hospital Infection Control (CPHIC) is also offered.\\n\\nThe campus features air-conditioned smart classrooms, NABL-accredited medical laboratories (Biochemistry, Microbiology, Haematology, Histopathology), and dedicated optometry clinics including a Contact Lens Clinic, Low Vision Clinic, Binocular Vision & Vision Therapy Clinic, Myopia Clinic, Pediatric Optometry Lab and Sports Clinic. The Medical Laboratory Sciences programme reports 100% placement, 135 undergraduate and 19 postgraduate graduates to date, 20+ student scholarships awarded, and clinical tie-ups with 3+ multi-specialty hospitals, including Kanchi Kamakoti Child Trust Hospital and Sundaram Medical Foundation.","highlights":["Founded by Late Padma Bhushan Dr. S.S. Badrinath (2010)","3 Schools — Optometry, Management Studies, Medical Laboratory Sciences","NCAHP-Aligned BMLS & MMLS Curriculum","NABL-Accredited On-Campus Laboratories","100% Placement Assistance (Official Claim)","Internship Tie-Ups with Kanchi Kamakoti Child Trust Hospital & Sundaram Medical Foundation","Collaboration with Rotary Central TTK-VHS Blood Bank for Transfusion Medicine Training","1000+ Students Enrolled","20+ Student Scholarships Awarded","Academic Collaboration with Hindustan Institute of Technology and Science"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Tech - Aeronautical Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech - Aerospace Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Aviation Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Avionics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Aircraft Maintenance","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Voc. - Aircraft Maintenance","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A - Aviation Management","level":"PG"},{"name":"BBA - Aviation Services and Air Cargo","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering - Aircraft Maintenance","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Aeronautical Engineering - Avionics","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Defence Technology - Aerospace Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Defence Technology - Communication Systems & Sensors","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.B.A. - Aviation Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"Advanced Master Program in Aviation Safety Management","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Air-Conditioned Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Air-Conditioned Library (Optometry/Healthcare/MLT)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"NABL-Accredited Medical Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Contact Lens, Low Vision & Binocular Vision Clinics"},{"icon":"ti-eye","name":"Pediatric Optometry & Myopia Clinic"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Support (100% Claimed)"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Blood Bank Collaboration (Rotary Central TTK-VHS)"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Digital Monitor-Enabled Interactive Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"National-Level Student Conferences & CMEs"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Alumni Talks & Industry Expert Meets"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Student Scholarship Programme (20+ Awarded)"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"Not published","highestPackage":"Not published","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"For BMLS: 10+2 (Science) with at least 50% aggregate in Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Botany & Zoology. For MMLS: Bachelor of Medical Laboratory Science with 50% minimum from a recognized university. For M.Optom and MHA: relevant bachelor''s degree as per programme-specific eligibility."},{"title":"Apply Online","desc":"Download and submit the UG/PG application form available on the official TSNA website, or apply through the Admissions section."},{"title":"Entrance Exam & Interview (for PG programmes)","desc":"MMLS and select postgraduate programmes require candidates to appear for an entrance exam and interview."},{"title":"Document Submission & Fee Payment","desc":"Submit required academic documents and complete fee payment as specified by the admissions office."},{"title":"Reporting & Enrollment","desc":"Report to the Dr. V.G. Appukutty Campus, St. Thomas Mount, with original documents for final enrollment."}],"scholarships":["20+ Student Scholarships Awarded (Medical Laboratory Sciences Programme, Official Figure)"],"events":["Braillive CME Quiz Competition (SRIHER) — Student Prize Winners","Poster Presentation Competitions (Inter-Collegiate CMEs)","Model Making Competition (e.g. VIZENSA obstacle-detection glasses project)","Blood Donation Camps","Yoga & Meditation Sessions","Sports & Cultural Events","Industrial Visits & Alumni Talks/Expert Meets"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"4 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"1 km (St. Thomas Mount Railway Station)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"0.5 km (St. Thomas Mount Metro Station, Chennai Metro Blue Line)","hospital":"Adjacent Network (Sankara Nethralaya Group Hospitals)"},"hostelFeatures":["Hostel Facility Available (Campus Life Section)"],"technicalClubs":["Optometry Clinical Skills Club","Medical Laboratory Research Club"],"culturalClubs":["Student Cultural & Sports Committee"],"communityService":["Blood Donation Camps","Community Optometry Fellowship (Vision Outreach)","Rotary Central TTK-VHS Blood Bank Collaboration"]}'),
('vasan-institute-of-ophthalmology-and-research-chennai','vasan-institute-of-ophthalmology-and-research-chennai','Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai','VIOR Chennai','allied-health-science','Private Optometry Institute (Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation)','Private (Vasan Foundation — Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)','2010','West Mambalam, Chennai','Chennai','127, Old Mambalam Road, West Mambalam, Chennai - 600033 (Opposite Annapoorani School)','https://maps.google.com/?q=Vasan+Institute+of+Ophthalmology+Research+West+Mambalam+Chennai','https://vasaninstitute.edu.in/','044-4860 2955 / +91 95855 48908','mailto:chennai@vasaninstitute.edu.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp','Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine','Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.',NULL, '{"id":"vasan-institute-of-ophthalmology-and-research-chennai","seo":{"metaTitle":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.","metaKeywords":["Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research","Chennai","VIOR Chennai","Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research","Chennai admission 2026","Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research","Chennai fees","Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research","Chennai courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Chennai","West Mambalam","Chennai","Chennai","Allied Health Science","Private (Vasan Foundation — Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","Private Optometry Institute (Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation (Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","No NEET Required for Admission (Official)","B.Optom (Bachelor of Optometry)","B.Optom Lateral Entry (For Diploma Holders)","M.Optom (Master of Optometry)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai","openGraph":{"title":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine","description":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research - CollegeShine","description":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai is a private (vasan foundation — vasan eye care / vasan healthcare group) allied health science college.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research, Chennai","shortName":"VIOR Chennai","tagline":"Become a Vision Expert","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Optometry Institute (Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation)","ownership":"Private (Vasan Foundation — Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","established":2010,"location":"West Mambalam, Chennai","district":"Chennai","address":"127, Old Mambalam Road, West Mambalam, Chennai - 600033 (Opposite Annapoorani School)","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Vasan+Institute+of+Ophthalmology+Research+West+Mambalam+Chennai","mapQuery":"Vasan+Institute+of+Ophthalmology+Research+West+Mambalam+Chennai","website":"https://vasaninstitute.edu.in/","phone":"044-4860 2955 / +91 95855 48908","email":"mailto:chennai@vasaninstitute.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Vasan-Institute-of-Ophthalmology-Research-Salem_26_11zon-300x300.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"B.Optom, B.Optom Lateral Entry & M.Optom programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation (Vasan Eye Care / Vasan Healthcare Group)","No NEET Required for Admission (Official)"],"about":"Vasan Institute of Ophthalmology & Research (VIOR) is an educational unit of Vasan Foundation, the education arm of the Vasan Healthcare Group — one of the world''s largest eye-care networks. Founded to build a pipeline of practice-ready primary eye-care professionals, VIOR offers three optometry programmes affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University: the flagship B.Optom (4 years plus 1-year internship, 20 seats), a B.Optom Lateral Entry route for existing diploma holders (direct 2nd-year entry, 3 years plus internship), and the M.Optom postgraduate programme (2 years, 15 seats).\\n\\nVIOR describes itself as ''clinic-first'' — 60% of the curriculum is practical, with clinical exposure from year one in the refraction lab, hospital internship rotations, and community eye-care camps. The institute operates across two campuses, Chennai (West Mambalam) and Salem, and has produced 9+ graduating batches to date. Faculty include internationally trained optometry educators (alumni of institutions such as BITS Pilani and the University of Houston, per official claims) who are also practising clinicians. A dedicated Careers & Placements cell runs on-campus drives with companies including Bausch + Lomb, Titan Eye+ and Lenskart, and highlights career pathways into hospitals, retail, industry and academia in India, the Middle East and the UK.","highlights":["Educational Unit of Vasan Foundation (Vasan Eye Care Group)","3 Optometry Degree Programmes — B.Optom, B.Optom Lateral Entry, M.Optom","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","No NEET Required for Admission","60% Practical/Clinical Curriculum Exposure","Clinical Training from Year One in Refraction Lab & Hospital Postings","Campus Placement Drives — Bausch + Lomb, Titan Eye+, Lenskart","2 Campuses — Chennai & Salem","9+ Graduating Batches","Faculty Include BITS Pilani & University of Houston Alumni (Official Claim)"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Optom (Bachelor of Optometry)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Optom Lateral Entry (For Diploma Holders)","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Optom (Master of Optometry)","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Smart Classrooms (Air-Conditioned, Multimedia)"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library (Journals, Reference & General Books)"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Optics Lab"},{"icon":"ti-eye","name":"Refraction & Clinical Practice Lab"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Network (Internships in Leading Eye Hospitals)"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Private Hostel Assistance Near Campus"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Dedicated Careers & Placements Cell"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Guest Lectures from Industry Experts"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Educational Tours & Industrial Visits"}],"placementRate":90,"avgPackage":"₹2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹4.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"B.Optom requires +2 with Science; B.Optom Lateral Entry is for existing diploma-in-optometry holders (direct 2nd-year entry); M.Optom requires a relevant bachelor''s degree. No NEET required."},{"title":"Apply Online","desc":"Complete the online application on the official Vasan Institute website — takes about 10 minutes; the admissions team follows up to complete the rest."},{"title":"Submit Personal & Educational Details","desc":"Provide personal details, prior academic records, and upload scanned copies of required documents."},{"title":"Pay Application Fee","desc":"Complete the application fee payment to confirm submission."},{"title":"Counselling & Enrollment","desc":"The admissions team contacts shortlisted candidates to complete counselling, document verification, and final enrollment."}],"scholarships":["Merit-Based Fee Concessions (Case-by-Case, Approx)"],"events":["OATN Walkathon Participation (Community, Mar 2026)","Industrial Visit to Hoya Lens Manufacturing Facility (Feb 2026)","Visit to National Institute for the Empowerment of Persons with Visual Disabilities, NIEPVD (Jan 2026)","Community Eye-Care Camps","Guest Lectures & Seminars"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"10 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"2.4 km (Mambalam Railway Station)","bustand":"1.5 km (T. Nagar Bus Stand)","metro":"3 km (Nearest Chennai Metro Station, approx)","hospital":"Within Vasan Eye Care Clinical Network"},"hostelFeatures":["No In-House Hostel — Institute Assists with Private Hostel Options Near Both Campuses","Private Hostels Nearby (Meals & Laundry Typically Included)"],"technicalClubs":["Optometry Skills & Refraction Club","Vision Research Interest Group"],"culturalClubs":["Student Cultural & Wellness Committee"],"communityService":["OATN Walkathon Participation","Community Eye-Care Screening Camps","Visit to National Institute for the Empowerment of Persons with Visual Disabilities (NIEPVD)","Free Vision Screening for Underprivileged Communities"]}'),
