('ganga-college-of-nursing-coimbatore-ahs','ganga-college-of-nursing-coimbatore-ahs','Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore','Ganga College of Nursing','allied-health-science','Private Health Sciences Institute (Nursing & Allied Health)','Private (Ganga Hospital Trust)','1978','Vattamalaipalayam, Coimbatore','Coimbatore','SF No.442, Vattamalaipalayam, NGGO Colony Post, Coimbatore - 641022, Tamil Nadu, India','https://maps.google.com/?q=Ganga+Institute+of+Health+Sciences+Coimbatore','https://gcon.edu.in/','0422-3501755','mailto:admin@gcon.edu.in','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp','Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine','Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.',NULL, '{"id":"ganga-college-of-nursing-coimbatore-ahs","seo":{"metaTitle":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.","metaKeywords":["Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences)","Coimbatore","Ganga College of Nursing","Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences)","Coimbatore admission 2026","Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences)","Coimbatore fees","Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences)","Coimbatore courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Coimbatore","Vattamalaipalayam","Coimbatore","Coimbatore","Allied Health Science","Private (Ganga Hospital Trust)","Private Health Sciences Institute (Nursing & Allied Health)","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by Indian Nursing Council (INC)","Recognized by Tamil Nadu Nurses & Midwives Council","1","050+ Alumni (Gangites)","B.Sc Accident & Emergency Care Technology","B.Sc Critical Care Technology","B.Sc Operation Theatre and Anesthesia Technology","B.Sc Physician Assistant","B.Sc Radiography and Imaging Technology"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore","openGraph":{"title":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine","description":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of - CollegeShine","description":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore is a private (ganga hospital trust) allied health science college in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Ganga College of Nursing (Ganga Institute of Health Sciences), Coimbatore","shortName":"Ganga College of Nursing","tagline":"Serving with Compassion and Commitment","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Health Sciences Institute (Nursing & Allied Health)","ownership":"Private (Ganga Hospital Trust)","established":1978,"location":"Vattamalaipalayam, Coimbatore","district":"Coimbatore","address":"SF No.442, Vattamalaipalayam, NGGO Colony Post, Coimbatore - 641022, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Ganga+Institute+of+Health+Sciences+Coimbatore","mapQuery":"Ganga+Institute+of+Health+Sciences+Coimbatore","website":"https://gcon.edu.in/","phone":"0422-3501755","email":"mailto:admin@gcon.edu.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ganga-college-of-nursing.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ylM9zkgtn28?si=T_NlyiU__r4RTJhf","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; nursing programmes recognized by the Indian Nursing Council (INC) and Tamil Nadu Nurses & Midwives Council","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized by Indian Nursing Council (INC)","Recognized by Tamil Nadu Nurses & Midwives Council","1,050+ Alumni (Gangites)","Attached to Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore"],"about":"Ganga Institute of Health Sciences (GIHS) comprises the School of Nursing and College of Nursing, situated in Vattamalaipalayam, 8 km from Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore. Ganga Hospital itself traces back to 1978, when it was started as Ganga Nursing Home by Dr. J.G. Shanmuganathan. The academic block is a spacious 54,000 sq. ft. structure encompassing classrooms, pre-clinical labs, a library, and an auditorium, set within a 13.42-acre campus, of which 49,000 sq. ft. houses separate Boys and Girls Hostels.\\n\\nGIHS offers nursing programmes including GNM, B.Sc Nursing, Post-Basic B.Sc Nursing, and M.Sc Nursing, alongside a strong Allied Health Sciences (AHS) wing with six B.Sc./M.Sc. programmes: Accident & Emergency Care Technology, Critical Care Technology, Operation Theatre & Anesthesia Technology, Physician Assistant, Radiography & Imaging Technology, and Medical Laboratory Technology, plus M.Sc. Clinical Nutrition — all 4-year UG programmes (except the 2-year-plus-6-month M.Sc.) affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University. With 40+ faculty, 10+ courses, and 1,050+ alumni (''Gangites''), the institute emphasizes academic and clinical excellence, research and innovation, and holistic student development.","highlights":["6 B.Sc./M.Sc. Allied Health Science Programmes","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","13.42-Acre Campus — 54,000 Sq. Ft. Academic Block","Attached to Ganga Hospital, Coimbatore (8 km away)","40+ Faculty, 10+ Courses, 1,050+ Alumni","Separa