ry Science is a small private allied health sciences training institute located in Palakarai, Tiruchirappalli, opposite Doctors Lab. The institute offers diploma and certificate-level training in medical laboratory technology, preparing students for careers as laboratory technicians and assistants in hospitals, diagnostic centres, and pathology labs.\\n\\nAs a locally-run paramedical training centre, the institute focuses on practical, hands-on instruction in laboratory procedures including sample collection, basic hematology, clinical biochemistry, and microbiology testing. Given its scale, it primarily serves students from the Tiruchirappalli region seeking an accessible entry point into laboratory technology careers, with training oriented toward employment in local hospitals, diagnostic centres, and pathology laboratories rather than large-scale placement drives.","highlights":["Located Opposite Doctors Lab, Palakarai, Trichy","Diploma-Level Medical Laboratory Technology Training","5.0 Rating on Public Directory Listings","Focus on Practical, Hands-On Laboratory Training","Accessible Entry Point for Local Students into Lab Technology Careers"],"departments":[{"name":"DMLT (Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"UG"},{"name":"CMLT (Certificate in Medical Laboratory Technology)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Basic Laboratory Training Facility"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Reference Library"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Proximity to Doctors Lab for Practical Exposure"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Local Placement Guidance"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Basic Diagnostic Equipment"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"Hands-On Practical Sessions"}],"placementRate":65,"avgPackage":"₹1.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹2.8 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Meet Eligibility Criteria","desc":"Candidates typically need to have passed 10+2 (Science stream preferred) for diploma-level laboratory courses; certificate courses may accept 10th pass."},{"title":"Visit or Contact the Institute","desc":"Since no official website is available, prospective students should contact or visit the institute directly at its Palakarai location for current course and admission details."},{"title":"Document Submission","desc":"Submit academic certificates and identity proof as required by the institute."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Complete fee payment to confirm admission into the desired course."}],"scholarships":["Fee Concessions for Deserving Students (as per Institute Discretion)"],"events":["Annual Practical Skills Assessment","Guest Sessions by Local Lab Professionals"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"6 km (Tiruchirappalli International Airport)","railway":"2 km (Trichy Junction)","bustand":"2 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Site (Adjacent to Doctors Lab)"},"hostelFeatures":["Day-Scholar Institute — No Hostel Facility"],"technicalClubs":["Informal Peer Study Group"],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["Occasional Free Health Screening Support (via Adjacent Doctors Lab)"]}'),
