gy (B.AOTT)","B.Sc Physician Associate (BPA)","B.Sc Emergency Medical Technologist (BEMT)"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Santhi College of Health Sciences","openGraph":{"title":"Santhi College of Health Sciences | Krishnagiri - CollegeShine","description":"Santhi College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Hosur, Krishnagiri established in 2009. A Valid Path for Dream Career Check.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Santhi College of Health Sciences | Krishnagiri - CollegeShine","description":"Santhi College of Health Sciences is a private allied health science college in Hosur, Krishnagiri established in 2009. A Valid Path for Dream Career Check.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Santhi College of Health Sciences","shortName":"Santhi College","tagline":"A Valid Path for Dream Career","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Self-Financing Paramedical College","ownership":"Private","established":2009,"location":"Hosur, Krishnagiri","district":"Krishnagiri","address":"Behind SBI, Near Chennai Silks, Opp. Lal, Mookandapalli, Sipcot 1, Hosur - 635126, Krishnagiri District, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d15565.826003392443!2d77.79718916977542!3d12.748839000000011!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae7179d5bee847%3A0x7f5d1e59d4491756!2sSanthi+College+of+Health+Sciences+Hosur+(Paramedical+Degree+Courses%2FParamedical+College)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1536216145387","mapQuery":"Santhi+College+of+Health+Sciences+Hosur+Krishnagiri","website":"http://santhicollege.com","phone":"04344-278777","email":"mailto:principal@santhicollege.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Santhi-Paramedical-Institute-Krishnagiri-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Recognized Paramedical Training Institution, Tamil Nadu"],"about":"Santhi College of Health Sciences was established in 2009 as Santhi Paramedical Institute, initially providing training in various diploma paramedical courses. The college is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and is led by Chairman Dr. B.M. Sundararajulu (MBBS, FCCP) and Director Dr. Saroja (MBBS, DGO).\\n\\nThe institution is supported by three parent hospitals with 50 beds each — Santhi Hospital & Jananam Fertility Centre in Hosur, B.M.S. Multi-Specialty Hospital in Hosur, and Vijayalakshmi Nursing Home in Denkanikottai — offering hands-on clinical exposure across casualty, medical-surgical, orthopedic, pediatric, OBG, ENT, ICU, IVF lab, major OT, trauma care, endoscopic surgery, laparoscopy, and diagnostic laboratory services. Students also receive in-course hospital training at partner hospitals across Hosur and Trichy, including B.M.S Hospital, Gunam Hospital, Varam Hospital, Janaraksha Multispeciality Hospital, and Star KIMS Hospital. The college has trained approximately 60 students annually since 2009 under diploma paramedical courses, and around 20 students annually under the PVP (Placement-linked Vocational Programme), with placement support arranged for each candidate. The college also conducts medical camps in villages surrounding Hosur and within the hospital campus.","highlights":["Established 2009 as Santhi Paramedical Institute","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Backed by 3 Parent Hospitals (150 Beds Combined)","In-Course Hospital Training at 10+ Partner Hospitals","Smart Classrooms with Projectors","Well-Equipped Laboratories","Computer Lab with Internet Facility","Separate Boys & Girls Hostel","PVP Programme with Placement Support","Regular Community Medical Camps"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc Medical Laboratory Sciences (BMLS)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Anaesthesia & Operation Theatre Technology (B.AOTT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Physician Associate (BPA)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Emergency Medical Technologist (BEMT)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Smart Classrooms with Projector"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Well-Equipped Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab with Internet Facility"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Library Facility"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separate Boys & Girls Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-cup","name":"Canteen Facility"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Playground Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"In-Course Hospital Training (3 Parent + 10+ Partner Hospitals)"}],"placementRate":65,"avgPackage":"₹1.8 LPA","highestPackage":"₹3.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Candidates must have completed 12 years of schooling from a recognized board with Physics, Chemistry, Biology or Botany & Zoology, with a minimum of 45% marks, and be at least 17 years old."},{"title":"Medical Fitness Certificate","desc":"Applicants attach a medical fitness certificate from an authorized medical officer along with their application."},{"title":"Eligibility Certificate (If Applicable)","desc":"Candidates who passed an examination other than the Tamil Nadu Government board must obtain an eligibility certificate from the affiliating university."},{"title":"Document Submission & Verification","desc":"Candidates submit academic records and required certificates to the college admission office for verification."},{"title":"Seat Confirmation & Enrollment","desc":"Selected candidates confirm their seat by paying the prescribed fees and complete enrollment formalities."}],"scholarships":["First Graduate Scholarship","BC / MBC Scholarship","SC / ST Scholarship","Post Matric Scholarship","Tamil Nadu Government Scholarship"],"events":["Community Medical Camps in Surrounding Villages","In-Campus Health Awareness Camps","PVP Programme Orientation"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Approx. 35-40 km (Kempegowda Intl. Airport, Bengaluru, nearest major airport)","railway":"Approx. 5-7 km (Hosur Railway Station)","bustand":"Approx. 2-3 km (Hosur Bus Stand)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"On Campus (Attached Parent Hospitals)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostels","Mess Facility","Basic Recreation Areas","Security"],"technicalClubs":["Clinical Skills Development Club","Emergency & Trauma Care Club","Lab Sciences Club"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Fine Arts Club"],"communityService":["Medical Camps in Villages Surrounding Hosur","In-Hospital-Campus Health Camps","Blood Donation Camps"]}'),
('st-marys-college-of-health-sciences-ahs','st-marys-college-of-health-sciences-ahs','St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)','St. Mary''s College','allied-health-science','Private Self-Financing College','Private','2025','Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus 1); Vasudevanallur, Kollam-Madurai Road (Campus 2)','Tenkasi','Thenpothai, Panpoli P.O., Shenkottai, Tenkasi District, Tamil Nadu - 627807','https://maps.google.com/?q=St+Mary''s+College+of+Health+Sciences+Shenkottai+Tenkasi','https://stmaryscolleges.com','04633-233222','mailto:stmarys198@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp','St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine','St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.',NULL, '{"id":"st-marys-college-of-health-sciences-ahs","seo":{"metaTitle":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.","metaKeywords":["St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)","St. Mary''s College","St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) admission 2026","St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) fees","St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) courses","Allied Health Science colleges in Tenkasi","Shenkottai","Tenkasi District (Campus 1); Vasudevanallur","Kollam-Madurai Road (Campus 2)","Tenkasi","Allied Health Science","Private","Private Self-Financing College","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","TNAI Approved","TNC Approved","INC Approved","B.Sc Nursing (Girls)","B.Sc Nursing (Boys)","BNYS (Bachelor of Naturopathy & Yogic Sciences)","B.Sc Cardiac Technology","B.Sc Radiography & Imaging"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)","openGraph":{"title":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine","description":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s - CollegeShine","description":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions) is a private allied health science college in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences (St. Mary''s Group of Institutions)","shortName":"St. Mary''s College","tagline":"Become the Heartbeat of Tomorrow","category":"allied-health-science","type":"Private Self-Financing College","ownership":"Private","established":2025,"location":"Shenkottai, Tenkasi District (Campus 1); Vasudevanallur, Kollam-Madurai Road (Campus 2)","district":"Tenkasi","address":"Thenpothai, Panpoli P.O., Shenkottai, Tenkasi District, Tamil Nadu - 627807","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=St+Mary''s+College+of+Health+Sciences+Shenkottai+Tenkasi","mapQuery":"St+Marys+College+of+Health+Sciences+Shenkottai+Tenkasi","website":"https://stmaryscolleges.com","phone":"04633-233222","email":"mailto:stmarys198@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/st-marys-college-of-health-science-tenkasi-collegeshine.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1eKWrOcplUI?si=-Ful8bHAifYM39Jm","affiliation":"Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University; TNAI, TNC & INC Approved","accreditation":["Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","TNAI Approved","TNC Approved","INC Approved","ISO 9001:2015 Certified"],"about":"St. Mary''s College of Health Sciences is part of St. Mary''s Group of Institutions, run by the Geevarghese Education & Charitable Trust and founded in 2025 by Founder & Chairman Adv. P.V. Binu. The group operates dual campuses — one in Shenkottai, Tenkasi District, Tamil Nadu, and another in Vasudevanallur on the Kollam-Madurai Road extending into Kerala — with a stated mission to produce highly qualified, internationally acceptable healthcare professionals through a value-based, integrated educational philosophy.\\n\\nThe institution offers a wide range of healthcare degree programmes including B.Sc Nursing, BNYS (Naturopathy), B.Sc Cardiac Technology, B.Sc Radiography & Imaging, B.Sc Operation Theatre & Anesthesia, B.Sc Medical Laboratory Technology, B.Sc Optometry, B.Sc Dialysis Technology, B.Pharm, D.Pharm, GNM, BPT, and B.Sc Agriculture. It is affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University and holds TNAI, TNC, and INC approvals, along with ISO 9001:2015 certification. The group has been recognized with the Mahathma Gandhi Excellence Award (2020), the Bharath Rathna Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Excellence Award (2019), and an Aviation Training Award (2019), and has held a convocation in partnership with Alagappa University.","highlights":["Founded 2025 Under Geevarghese Education & Charitable Trust","Dual Campuses — Tamil Nadu & Kerala","Affiliated to The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","TNAI, TNC & INC Approved, ISO 9001:2015 Certified","14 Healthcare Degree Programmes Offered","Transparent, Published Year-Wise Fee Structure","Mahathma Gandhi Excellence Award 2020","Bharath Rathna Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Excellence Award 2019","34th Convocation Held at Alagappa University","Value-Based Integrated Educational Philosophy"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc Nursing (Girls)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Nursing (Boys)","level":"UG"},{"name":"BNYS (Bachelor of Naturopathy & Yogic Sciences)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Cardiac Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Radiography & Imaging","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Operation Theatre & Anesthesia","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Medical Laboratory Technology (MLT)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Optometry","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Dialysis Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Pharm","level":"UG"},{"name":"D.Pharm","level":"Diploma"},{"name":"B.Sc Agriculture","level":"UG"},{"name":"GNM (General Nursing & Midwifery)","level":"UG"},{"name":"BPT (Bachelor of Physiotherapy)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Dual Campus (Tamil Nadu & Kerala)"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Clinical Training Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Modern Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Programme-Specific Labs (Cardiac, Radiography, OT, MLT, Optometry)"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Excellence Award-Recognized Faculty & Programmes"},{"icon":"ti-medall","name":"ISO 9001:2015 Certified Campus Standards"}],"placementRate":0,"avgPackage":"Not Published","highestPackage":"Not Published","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Explore Programmes & Fees","desc":"Prospective students review the available healthcare degree programmes and the published transparent fee structure on the official website."},{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Candidates confirm eligibility for their chosen programme (10+2 with relevant science subjects for most B.Sc/B.Pharm/BPT/BNYS courses)."},{"title":"Apply Online / Campus Tour","desc":"Candidates apply via the ''Apply Now'' option on the website or schedule a campus tour before applying."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"