nary and Animal Sciences University (TANUVAS), located at Alamathi-Koduvalli near Chennai. The institution traces its origin to the establishment of the Institute of Dairying in 1991 by the Government of Tamil Nadu. The campus is spread across approximately 82.12 acres and focuses on education, research, extension and technology development in Food and Dairy Technology. The B.Tech Food Technology programme was introduced in 2006 and the institution was renamed as College of Food and Dairy Technology in 2012.\\n\\nThe college offers undergraduate, postgraduate and doctoral programmes in Food Technology and Dairy Technology. Its academic portfolio includes B.Tech Food Technology, B.Tech Dairy Technology, M.Tech Food Technology, M.Tech Dairy Technology, M.Tech Dairy Chemistry and Ph.D Food Technology. The institution has departments covering Food Processing Technology, Food Process Engineering, Dairy Technology, Dairy Chemistry and Food Safety & Quality Assurance. Its infrastructure includes food processing plants, analytical and quality control facilities, incubation facilities, research laboratories and facilities for pilot and commercial scale production of food products.","highlights":["82.12-Acre Campus","Constituent College of TANUVAS","Established as Institute of Dairying in 1991","B.Tech Food Technology Since 2006","B.Tech Dairy Technology Since 2014","AICTE Recognized Programmes","ICAR Accredited B.Tech Food Technology","Food Processing and Dairy Technology Research","Food Business Incubation Centre","Dairy Food Analytical & Quality Control Laboratory","Food and Dairy Consultancy Services","Industry-Oriented Training and Extension Activities"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Tech Food Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech Dairy Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Tech Food Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech Dairy Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech Dairy Chemistry","level":"PG"},{"name":"Ph.D Food Technology","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wide Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Food Technology Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Dairy Technology Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Computing Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-industry","name":"Food Processing Plants"},{"icon":"ti-heartbeat","name":"Food Analytical & Quality Control Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Food Business Incubation Centre"},{"icon":"ti-briefcase","name":"Food & Dairy Consultancy Service Cell"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar and Conference Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports and Extracurricular Facilities"}],"placementRate":88,"avgPackage":"₹4.0 LPA","highestPackage":"₹7.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Candidates should satisfy the academic eligibility requirements prescribed by TANUVAS for the selected Food or Dairy Technology programme."},{"title":"Submit Application","desc":"Eligible candidates apply through the admission process prescribed by TANUVAS for the relevant academic year."},{"title":"Merit-Based Selection","desc":"Admission is made according to the applicable TANUVAS admission and merit criteria."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Academic, identity and other required documents are verified during the admission process."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Selected candidates complete the prescribed fee payment and report to the college for enrollment."}],"scholarships":["TANUVAS Scholarship Schemes","Government Scholarships","SC / ST Scholarship","BC / MBC Scholarship","First Graduate Scholarship","Post Matric Scholarship","Merit-Based Scholarship","Government Welfare Scholarships","Research Fellowship Assistance","Financial Assistance as per Government Norms"],"events":["Food Technology Workshops","Dairy Technology Training Programmes","Food Processing Skill Development Programmes","Research and Innovation Activities","Food Safety Awareness Programmes","Industrial Training and Visits","Entrepreneurship Development Programmes","Technology Demonstration Programmes"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"43 km","railway":"27 km","bustand":"27 km","metro":"N/A","hospital":"Approx. 5-10 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate Boys & Girls Hostel Facilities","Campus Security","Wi-Fi Facility","Mess Facility","Study Areas","Recreation Facilities","Common Rooms","Basic Medical Support"],"technicalClubs":["Food Technology Research Club","Dairy Technology Club","Food Processing Innovation Club","Food Safety and Quality Club","Entrepreneurship and Incubation Cell"],"culturalClubs":["Dance Club","Music Club","Drama Club","Fine Arts Club","Photography Club"],"communityService":["Food Safety Awareness Programmes","Food Processing Training","Entrepreneurship Training","Farmer Training Programmes","Rural Youth Skill Development","Self Help Group Training","Technology Demonstration Programmes","Extension Education Activities"]}'),
