tion and Management (CPPM), Hosur was established by the Government of Tamil Nadu during 2011-12 through Government Order Ms. No. 81 dated 08.08.2011. Located at Mathigiri, Hosur, on an extensive 80-acre campus, the institution functions as a constituent college of Tamil Nadu Veterinary and Animal Sciences University (TANUVAS). The college was established with the objective of developing skilled professionals for the poultry sector and focuses on poultry production, engineering, processing technology, feed technology and poultry business management.\\n\\nThe college offers B.Tech. in Poultry Technology and M.Tech. in Poultry Technology. The undergraduate programme provides academic learning combined with industrial training, field visits, practical sessions, guest lectures and experiential learning. The campus includes poultry farm and hatchery facilities, engineering and technology laboratories, feed manufacturing facilities, analytical laboratories, library, hostels, sports infrastructure, health facilities and conference facilities. Research, extension activities, farmer training and technology dissemination are also important components of the institution.","highlights":["80-Acre Campus at Mathigiri, Hosur","Constituent College of TANUVAS","Established During 2011-12","B.Tech Poultry Technology Programme","M.Tech Poultry Technology Programme","AICTE Approved B.Tech Programme","Specialised Poultry Farm Complex","Automated Hatchery and Poultry Processing Facilities","2 Tonne Per Hour Feed Manufacturing Facility","Feed Analytical and Quality Control Laboratory","1900+ Books and E-Library","100% Placement Reported by Official College Source"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Tech (Poultry Technology)","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Tech (Poultry Technology)","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Internet & E-Library"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Specialised Poultry Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Separa